B.WG=s(["Y\xfczmek en sevdi\u011fim spordur.","Okumay\u0131 \xe7ok severim.","Erken kalkmak zor geliyor.","Bah\xe7eyi sulamak onun g\xf6reviydi.","Y\xfcr\xfcy\xfc\u015f yapmak kalbe iyi gelir.","Yazmak sab\u0131r isteyen bir i\u015ftir.","Onun g\xfcl\xfc\u015f\xfc hepimizi rahatlatt\u0131.","Konu\u015fmay\u0131 bitirince salondan \xe7\u0131kt\u0131.","Beklemek en zor k\u0131sm\u0131yd\u0131.","Ders \xe7al\u0131\u015fmak al\u0131\u015fkanl\u0131k gerektirir."],t.s)
B.a_k=s(["K\u0131r\u0131lan cam\u0131 hemen de\u011fi\u015ftirdiler.","Gelen misafirleri kap\u0131da kar\u015f\u0131lad\u0131.","Yaz\u0131lan mektup adrese ula\u015ft\u0131.","Konu\u015fan ki\u015fi s\u0131n\u0131f \xf6\u011fretmeniydi.","Susuz kalan \xe7i\xe7ekleri sulad\u0131.","Yorulan \xf6\u011frenciler mola verdi.","Okunacak kitaplar\u0131 rafa dizdi.","Tan\u0131mad\u0131\u011f\u0131m biri kap\u0131y\u0131 \xe7ald\u0131.","Akan sular bulanm\u0131\u015ft\u0131.","Kaybolan anahtar\u0131 bah\xe7ede buldular."],t.s)
B.a0s=s(["Ko\u015farak yan\u0131m\u0131za geldi.","Eve gelince hemen \xe7ay demledi.","Kap\u0131y\u0131 a\xe7\u0131p i\xe7eri girdi.","Bizi g\xf6r\xfcnce elini sallad\u0131.","Konu\u015fmadan odadan \xe7\u0131kt\u0131.","Ya\u011fmur ya\u011fd\u0131k\xe7a yollar \u0131slan\u0131yordu.","G\xfcl\xfcmseyerek bize bak\u0131yordu.","Ders \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131rken m\xfczik dinlemez.","Otob\xfcsten inip caddeyi ge\xe7ti.","Bakmadan kar\u015f\u0131ya ge\xe7meyin."],t.s)
B.Wy=s(["Yar\u0131n sabah erkenden yola \xe7\u0131kaca\u011f\u0131z.","Sabah \xe7ok erken kalkt\u0131m.","Bug\xfcn hava olduk\xe7a g\xfczel.","Kalemi masan\u0131n \xfczerine b\u0131rakt\u0131m.","Misafirler az \xf6nce ayr\u0131ld\u0131.","\xd6\u011fretmen soruyu tahtaya yazd\u0131.","Bah\xe7edeki a\u011fa\xe7lar \xe7i\xe7ek a\xe7t\u0131.","Toplant\u0131 tam iki saat s\xfcrd\xfc.","\xc7ocuklar ak\u015fama kadar oynad\u0131.","Bu \u015fehir her mevsim g\xfczeldir."],t.s)
